    "detailed_description": "Swipe Tennis is an immersive sports game that offers players an opportunity to test their mouse skills by becoming a tennis champion. With its intuitive controls, players must hold down the mouse button and swipe their mouse to hit the ball and outplay their opponents in a series of exciting and challenging matches. The game features an array of advanced gameplay mechanics, including different court surfaces, power-ups, and tougher opponents, as players progress through the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo play the game, simply hold down the mouse button and swipe in the direction you want to hit the ball with your tennis racket. The racket will follow the direction of your mouse, allowing for precise shots and strategic gameplay. With its stunning graphics and realistic sound effects, Swipe Tennis offers a truly immersive and authentic tennis experience for players of all levels. Whether you are a casual player looking for a quick game or a serious tennis enthusiast seeking a challenge, Swipe Tennis has something to offer for everyone.",
